# Project Structure

Monsters Suvivor is a multi-module [libGDX](https://libgdx.com/) survivor game (Java 20, Gradle). Generated with [gdx-liftoff](https://github.com/libgdx/gdx-liftoff). Package root: `com.deivi.monstersurvivor`.

## Top-Level Layout

```
game-survivor/
├── assets/                  # Shared game assets (source of truth)
├── core/                    # Platform-agnostic game logic
├── lwjgl3/                  # Desktop launcher (LWJGL3 backend)
├── teavm/                   # Web launcher (TeaVM backend)
├── gradle/                  # Gradle wrapper and daemon config
├── .cursor/rules/           # Cursor AI rules
├── build.gradle             # Root Gradle config and shared tasks
├── settings.gradle          # Subproject list: lwjgl3, core, teavm
├── gradle.properties        # Versions (gdx, lwjgl3, teavm) and build flags
├── gradlew / gradlew.bat    # Gradle wrapper scripts
├── README.md                # Controls, credits, project overview
└── LICENSE
```

## Gradle Modules

| Module   | Role | Entry point |
|----------|------|-------------|
| `core`   | Shared game code; depends only on libGDX | `MonstersSuvivor.java` |
| `lwjgl3` | Desktop app; depends on `core` | `Lwjgl3Launcher.java` |
| `teavm`  | Web build; depends on `core` | `TeaVMBuilder.java` / `TeaVMLauncher.java` |

- **Run desktop:** `./gradlew lwjgl3:run` (working dir is `assets/`)
- **Run web (dev server):** `./gradlew teavm:runRelease` → http://localhost:8080/
- **Build desktop JAR:** `./gradlew lwjgl3:jar`
- **Build native installers:** `./gradlew lwjgl3:package` (Construo)

## Source Files (`core`)

All game logic lives under `core/src/main/java/com/deivi/monstersurvivor/`:

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `MonstersSuvivor.java` | Main `Game` class; owns batch, font, shape renderer; sets initial screen |
| `ControlScreen.java` | Title / controls screen (SPACE to start) |
| `GameScreen.java` | Main gameplay loop, spawning, collisions, UI |
| `GameObject.java` | Abstract base for entities (position, texture, rect, draw) |
| `Player.java` | Player movement and state |
| `Enemy.java` | Enemy behavior |
| `Attack.java` | Slash attack animation and hit detection |

## Platform Launchers

**Desktop (`lwjgl3/src/main/java/com/deivi/monstersurvivor/lwjgl3/`):**
- `Lwjgl3Launcher.java` — application entry; creates libGDX desktop config
- `StartupHelper.java` — macOS / JVM startup helpers

**Web (`teavm/src/main/java/com/deivi/monstersurvivor/teavm/`):**
- `TeaVMBuilder.java` — Gradle-invoked build and dev-server runner
- `TeaVMLauncher.java` — TeaVM application config

**Desktop extras:**
- `lwjgl3/icons/` — app icons (`.ico`, `.icns`, `.png`) for packaged builds
- `lwjgl3/nativeimage.gradle` — Graal Native Image config (when `enableGraalNative=true`)

## Assets (`assets/`)

Shared across backends via `sourceSets.main.resources.srcDirs` in `lwjgl3` and `teavm` build files. Load paths via `Gdx.files.internal()` are relative to the `assets/` root (e.g. `graphics/player.png`).

```
assets/
├── graphics/              # Sprites, backgrounds, TextureAtlas (.atlas + .png)
├── audio/
│   ├── music/             # Streamed music (.mp3, .ogg)
│   └── sounds/            # Short effects (.wav)
├── fonts/                 # TrueType (.ttf) or bitmap (.fnt) fonts
├── maps/                  # Tiled maps (.tmx) and tilesets
├── ui/                    # Scene2D UI skins and JSON
└── assets.txt             # Auto-generated manifest (gitignored)
```

| Path | Contents |
|------|----------|
| `graphics/` | `player.png`, `slime.png`, `bgd.png`, `slash_00.png` … `slash_13.png` |
| `audio/music/` | `nightsplitter.mp3` |
| `audio/sounds/` | `slash.wav` |
| `fonts/` | `CherryCreamSoda-Regular.ttf` |
| `maps/` | Reserved for Tiled maps |
| `ui/` | Reserved for Scene2D skins |

The root `build.gradle` registers `generateAssetList`, which rebuilds `assets.txt` before `processResources`.

## Build / Generated Directories (do not edit)

- `build/`, `core/build/`, `lwjgl3/build/`, `teavm/build/` — Gradle output
- `.gradle/` — Gradle cache
- `assets/assets.txt` — generated at build time

## Configuration Files

| File | Notes |
|------|-------|
| `gradle.properties` | `gdxVersion`, `gdxTeaVMVersion`, `lwjgl3Version`, `projectVersion`, `enableGraalNative` |
| `core/build.gradle` | libGDX + FreeType dependencies |
| `lwjgl3/build.gradle` | LWJGL3 backend, Construo packaging, platform JAR tasks |
| `teavm/build.gradle` | TeaVM backend, `runRelease` / `buildRelease` tasks |
| `.editorconfig` | Editor formatting defaults |
| `.gitignore` | Ignores build dirs, IDE files, generated `assets.txt` |

## Conventions

- **New gameplay code** → `core/src/main/java/com/deivi/monstersurvivor/`
- **New assets** → appropriate subfolder under `assets/` (`graphics/`, `audio/music/`, `audio/sounds/`, `fonts/`, `maps/`, `ui/`); run a Gradle build to refresh `assets.txt`
- **Desktop-only changes** → `lwjgl3/`
- **Web-only changes** → `teavm/`
- **Do not** add platform-specific code to `core`; keep it backend-agnostic
- Entity classes extend `GameObject`; screens extend libGDX `ScreenAdapter`

